# Backends that do NOT yet honour the display backing scale.
#
# Each one renders a 1x image that the compositor upscales, which is the blur
# users see on a HiDPI screen. Deleting a line is the proof the fix landed;
# the gate fails while a line is here but the backend is wired.
#
# mac is deliberately absent: it renders at `backing_scale` (2x on Retina).
linux
